--- a/project/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/project/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,10 @@
+## 00.15 / M29BR — 2026-09-13
+
+- Restored the hardware-proven M29BM/M29BP connectionless-local server null-safety lost during the M29BQ source reconstruction.
+- Fixes the pre-world crash in `CLTServer::GetClientAddr` when FEAR's authentic in-process local client has no packet-level `CBaseConn`.
+- Restores null-safe local file-transfer, replication, endpoint scanning, and kick/remove handling.
+- Keeps the M29BQ global Model00p v33 physics-shape layout solver unchanged.
+
 ## M17 — ARM-ClientShell-Grenze
 
 - Vita ELF/SELF architecture verified as 32-bit ARMv7; io=64 uses 64-bit file offsets only.
